# GraphQL Security Cheat Sheet

## 🔥 High-Impact Findings

- IDOR / BOLA through user(id: X)
- Introspection exposed
- Sensitive fields exposed (password, token)
- No rate limiting on queries
- Aliasing to enumerate users
- Deep recursion DoS

